      "status": "verified",
      "sourceIds": [
        "official-pricing",
        "official-permissions",
        "official-reviews",
        "official-inbox"
      ]
    },
    {
      "statement": "The live monthly pricing page lists Professional at $79 for 15 profiles, Advanced at $149 for 30, and Scale at $349 for 70. It also lists a $29 monthly X add-on and $75 monthly wider-listening add-on.",
      "kind": "fact",
      "status": "verified",
      "sourceIds": [
        "official-pricing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "statement": "The live pricing page showed two, four, and eight included users, while a separate help article showed three, six, and ten.",
      "kind": "fact",
      "status": "verified",
      "sourceIds": [
        "official-pricing",
        "official-user-limits"
      ]
    },
    {
      "statement": "Broad capability, centralized posting, the shared inbox, and responsive support are common strengths.",
