  "scoreRationale": {
    "onboarding": "The basic publishing flow is approachable, but a full agency setup has many profiles, roles, inbox rules, and reports to configure.",
    "product": "Breadth is the main advantage. The web app can replace several narrower tools, though mobile gaps and connection issues remain concerns.",
    "support": "Responsive support is commonly praised, but billing and account complaints appear on Trustpilot.",
    "billing": "The base packages are clear, but add-ons and conflicting included-user documentation require a checkout check.",
    "overall": "Vista Social makes sense for a team that will use publishing, inbox, reviews, and approvals together. It is too much for someone who only needs a calendar."
  },
